    "## OSIRIS capability tour\n",
    "The upstream project documents a 3D map cockpit, aviation and maritime context, satellites and solar weather, 24/7 broadcasts, OI Assist and OI Forecast, OSINT investigation tools, cyber/CVE lookups, crypto tracing, and sanctions search. Some capabilities need user keys or a backend. Read [upstream README](https://github.com/simplifaisoul/osiris), [deployment notes](https://github.com/simplifaisoul/osiris/blob/master/DOCKER.md), and the [live console](https://osirisai.live/) before enabling them.\n",
    "\n",
    "| VEOC-adjacent | Broader cockpit / specialist use |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| Map layers, event time, cameras, verified briefings | Forecast experiments, RECON scans, wallet tracing |\n",
    "| Logistics context and public broadcasts | Sanctions and cyber investigations |\n",
    "| Explicit operational handover | OI interactions on a personally supplied model key |"
   ]
