    "## A cockpit checklist\n",
    "1. Pick a question and geography. 2. Turn on only relevant layers. 3. Record source and update time. 4. Open original evidence. 5. Separate inference from observation. 6. Export a dated briefing.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Video and imagery desk:** [OSIRIS live camera and broadcast interface](https://osirisai.live/) Ã‚Â· [NOAA satellite imagery](https://www.star.nesdis.noaa.gov/GOES/) Ã‚Â· [NASA Earth Observatory videos](https://earthobservatory.nasa.gov/videos). These are external media links; availability and rights remain with their providers."
